{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work  at the CSP Robotics company. The night is quiet and your shift is about to end. But the robots  have a different plan for tonight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inspect anomalous robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor may host an anomaly. Inspect every robot for rogue behavior or hardware modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/RobotAnomalyGif_Belly_Compressed.gif?t=1745413731\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leave the building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse in a liminal atmosphere. The rooms seem to repeat with no end. You will feel alone and surrounded at the same time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Scares, but not jumpscares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There may be some sudden movement, a shape could run out of sight. But nothing will jump to your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don't lower your guard. Some robots may resort to violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/RobotAnomalyGifRunning_Compressed.gif?t=1745413731\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30-90 minutes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fail on the first 8 floors and progress will reset</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pass 8th floor and your progress will be locked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go down to ground floor to unlock the anomaly museum</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Go underground to unlock all the anomalies</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583330?t=1745413731","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3583330?t=1745413731","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/8b34e263fe04ffd792d9e48d3958190664d17ff1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745413731","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/8b34e263fe04ffd792d9e48d3958190664d17ff1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745413731","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3619430,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You work  at the CSP Robotics company. The night is quiet and your shift is about to end. But the robots  have a different plan for tonight.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Inspect anomalous robots</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each floor may host an anomaly. Inspect every robot for rogue behavior or hardware modifications.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/RobotAnomalyGif_Belly_Compressed.gif?t=1745413731\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Leave the building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immerse in a liminal atmosphere. The rooms seem to repeat with no end. You will feel alone and surrounded at the same time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Scares, but not jumpscares</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There may be some sudden movement, a shape could run out of sight. But nothing will jump to your face.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But don't lower your guard. Some robots may resort to violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3583330/extras/RobotAnomalyGifRunning_Compressed.gif?t=1745413731\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Play Time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30-90 minutes</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"b